From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mckenna654 <mckenna654@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:56:33 +1100
Subject: fix: CHANGE only when there is someone to change to; no Oak lecture
 on the party screen; menu drawn in the message window

Found by code review of the playtest fixes:
- The party screen opened in the first rival battle still ran Oak's lecture about
  the list of Pokemon. It now obeys LT_OakBattleLectureActive like the rest.
- With one Pokemon, CHANGE opened a list where no choice works and pressing A goes
  round in circles. The button is left out unless another Pokemon can come in.
- The picture menu is drawn into B_WIN_MSG with a palette override instead of a
  window of its own, so it costs no extra memory in battle.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CNqSDphYuD2Aqe9TExdQMP

